src/termio/stream_handler.zig:648:         // behavior so this comment will go deep into trying to explain it.
src/termio/stream_handler.zig:649:         //
src/termio/stream_handler.zig:650:         // There are two ways to set cursor blinks: DECSCUSR (CSI _ q)
src/termio/stream_handler.zig:651:         // and DEC mode 12. DECSCUSR is the modern approach and has a
src/termio/stream_handler.zig:652:         // way to revert to the "default" (as defined by the terminal)
